| MkRDP  -  build !RDPClient with the local DDE (Norcroft) on RISC OS.
| Generated from build/plan.json, with -memaccess -L22-S22-L41 -Otime added
| (the DDE Norcroft supports -memaccess; the online 5.18 did not).
|
| Run from the RDPClient build root (where c., rdesktop., desklib., openssl.,
| hacklib., tabd., pane2. live). Produces out.RDPClient (Absolute, &FF8).
|
| ---- Set up the DDE compiler paths ----
| EDIT DDE$Dir to point at YOUR DDE, or delete the next two lines if your
| DDE is already booted (C:, TCPIPLibs: already set) at startup.
Set DDE$Dir SDFS::RISCOSpi.$.Programming.DDE
Obey <DDE$Dir>.!SetPaths

Set DeskLib$Path @.desklib.
Set OpenSSLLib$Path @.openssl.
Set HackLib$Path @.hacklib.
Set C$Path <C$Path>,@.openssl.,@.hacklib.
CDir o

